  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "Your **ORKS** units that have this ability get to re-roll their [Advance rolls](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move), and other rules can make them **riled up**. While one of them is **riled up**:\n\n- it gets a 5+ invulnerable save\n- its ranged attacks get **[[ASSAULT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/assault)**\n- it can still declare a charge after making an **[advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move)**\n\n**War Cry**: For your whole army, once per battle, as [either player's Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins, you can make every **ORKS** unit of yours with the **Waaagh!** ability **riled up** until the next turn ends.",
